>to hold</span> <span begin="0:24.354" end="0:24.947">back,</span> <span begin="0:24.947" end="0:25.253">not</span> <span begin="0:25.253" end="0:25.756">for</span> <span begin="0:25.756" end="0:26.325">a mi</span><span begin="0:26.325" end="0:26.810">nute</span></p><p begin="0:27.185" end="0:30.964" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:27.185" end="0:27.464">I'm pain</span><span begin="0:27.464" end="0:27.674">ting</span> <span begin="0:27.674" end="0:27.776">a</span> <span begin="0:27.776" end="0:28.267">pic</span><span begin="0:28.267" end="0:28.667">ture</span> <span begin="0:28.796" end="0:28.957">and</span> <span begin="0:28.957" end="0:29.387">I</span> <span begin="0:29.387" end="0:29.733">want</span> <span begin="0:29.733" end="0:29.907">you</span> <span begin="0:30.037" end="0:30.426">in</span> <span begin="0:30.426" end="0:30.964">it</span></p><p begin="0:31.173" end="0:34.797" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:31.173" end="0:31.363">Anyt</span><span begin="0:31.363" end="0:31.695">hing</span> <span begin="0:31.695" end="0:32.007">you</span> <span begin="0:32.007" end="0:32.534">dream</span> <span begin="0:32.534" end="0:32.962">of</span> <span begin="0:32.962" end="0:33.430">I'll</span> <span begin="0:33.430" end="0:33.755">let</span> <span begin="0:33.755" end="0:33.958">you</span> <span begin="0:33.958" end="0:34.392">live</span> <span begin="0:34.392" end="0:34.797">it</span></p><p begin="0:34.959" end="0:38.337" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:34.959" end="0:35.290">I</span> <span begin="0:35.290" end="0:35.457">just</span> <span begin="0:35.457" end="0:35.690">need</span> <span begin="0:35.690" end="0:36.439">to know</span> <span begin="0:36.439" end="0:36.697">if</span> <span begin="0:36.697" end="0:36.828">we're</span> <span begin="0:36.828" end="0:37.469">going</span> <span begin="0:37.469" end="0:37.858">somew</span><span begin="0:37.858" end="0:38.337">here</span></p><p begin="0:38.418" end="0:40.553" itunes:ke